add("Solids & Fluids", "M", "Two wires A and B are of same material. Wire A has radius r and wire B has radius 2r. If both are stretched by equal force F, the ratio of stress in A to stress in B is:", ["1 : 1", "2 : 1", "4 : 1", "1 : 4"], 2, "Stress = F / A = F / (π r²). Stress_A / Stress_B = (2r)² / r² = 4 : 1.")
add("Solids & Fluids", "H", "A soap bubble of radius r has excess pressure ΔP1. If it is blown to double its radius 2r, the excess pressure ΔP2 becomes:", ["ΔP1 / 2", "ΔP1 / 4", "2 ΔP1", "4 ΔP1"], 0, "Excess pressure in soap bubble ΔP = 4T / r. Thus ΔP2 / ΔP1 = r / (2r) = 1/2 => ΔP2 = ΔP1 / 2.")
