add("Thermal Properties", "H", "50 g of ice at 0°C is mixed with 50 g of water at 80°C. The final equilibrium temperature of the mixture is: (Latent heat of fusion of ice = 80 cal/g, specific heat of water = 1 cal/g·°C)", ["0°C", "20°C", "40°C", "50°C"], 0, "Heat required to melt all ice = 50 * 80 = 4000 cal. Heat available from water cooling to 0°C = 50 * 1 * 80 = 4000 cal. All ice melts, final temp = 0°C.")
