add("Kinetic Theory of Gases", "M", "If pressure of a fixed mass of ideal gas is doubled at constant temperature, its density becomes:", ["Half", "Double", "Four times", "Unchanged"], 1, "P = ρ R T / M => ρ ∝ P (at constant T). Doubling pressure doubles density.")
