add("Electrostatics", "M", "Electric field intensity at a distance r from an infinitely long straight wire carrying uniform linear charge density λ is:", ["λ / (2 π ε0 r)", "λ / (4 π ε0 r²)", "λ / (2 ε0 r)", "2 λ / (π ε0 r)"], 0, "By Gauss's law for infinite cylinder: E = λ / (2 π ε0 r).")
