add("Potential & Capacitance", "M", "Work done in moving a charge of 5 μC between two points on an equipotential surface at 50 V is:", ["250 μJ", "50 μJ", "Zero", "10 μJ"], 2, "On equipotential surface ΔV = 0. Work W = q ΔV = 5 μC * 0 = 0.")
add("Potential & Capacitance", "H", "Electric potential V at a point (x,y,z) is given by V = 6 x - 8 x y² - 8 y + 6 z. Electric field intensity at origin (0,0,0) is:", ["-6 i + 8 j - 6 k", "6 i + 8 j - 6 k", "-6 i - 8 j + 6 k", "8 i - 6 j + 6 k"], 0, "E_x = -∂V/∂x = -(6 - 8y²)|(0,0,0) = -6. E_y = -∂V/∂y = -(-16xy - 8)|(0,0,0) = +8. E_z = -∂V/∂z = -6. Thus E = -6 i + 8 j - 6 k N/C.")
