add("EM Waves", "H", "Electromagnetic waves are produced by:", ["A charge at rest", "A charge moving with uniform velocity", "An accelerating or oscillating charge", "A neutral particle"], 2, "Accelerating or oscillating electric charges radiate energy in the form of electromagnetic waves.")
